Are you here to disturb my rest?","nextNodeIds":[710591102]},{"nodeId":710591102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3170578946,"text":"Nope, we just wanna talk to you, seeing you sitting here all by your lonesome.","nextNodeIds":[710591103,710591104]},{"nodeId":710591103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1726026698,"text":"It must be quite boring to drink alone.","nextNodeIds":[710591105]},{"nodeId":710591105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":1008167746,"text":"Is that so? Thank you. You... remind me of Lyudochka.","nextNodeIds":[710591106]},{"nodeId":710591106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":1270665714,"text":"She's really enthusiastic, just like you... She kept sticking with me, telling me all sorts of things... I was the only one she often confided certain things to.","nextNodeIds":[710591107]},{"nodeId":710591107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":2899750794,"text":"*sigh* How I wish she was around. She's such a fun person. I bet you'd like her if you saw her.","nextNodeIds":[710591108,710591113]},{"nodeId":710591108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3455739210,"text":"Lyudochka? Who is she?","nextNodeIds":[710591109]},{"nodeId":710591109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":992028946,"text":"A friend of mine. Though she may appear serious, she's a funny little pumpkin.","nextNodeIds":[710591110]},{"nodeId":710591110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":3764206554,"text":"We were like sisters back in the House of the Hearth — I'd say that she was even dearer than a real sister. She liked to tease me... And she also looked after me.","nextNodeIds":[710591111]},{"nodeId":710591111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":1444174802,"text":"Haha, anyway, I have a hunch that she's doing fine out there. With this thought in mind, all the injuries that I got in this hell of a place seem to feel like nothing.","nextNodeIds":[710591112]},{"nodeId":710591112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":3320611346,"text":"I hope she's doing her job alright... Hope she doesn't think of me.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710591113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1735375898,"text":"Lyudochka... You mean the one in Inazuma...","nextNodeIds":[710591114]},{"nodeId":710591114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":612921674,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[710591115]},{"nodeId":710591115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":3064663194,"text":"So, her cover was blown...","nextNodeIds":[710591116]},{"nodeId":710591116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":947696034,"text":"Eh, how did you know?","nextNodeIds":[710591117,710591118]},{"nodeId":710591117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1451555786,"text":"She... managed to escape.","nextNodeIds":[710591119]},{"nodeId":710591119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":849934098,"text":"Really?","nextNodeIds":[710591120]},{"nodeId":710591120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":4023618618,"text":"Haha... That's a relief to know. Let's hope she's still doing her job well.","nextNodeIds":[710591121]},{"nodeId":710591121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":1284712466,"text":"But if she betrays the Tsaritsa for fear of death...","nextNodeIds":[710591122]},{"nodeId":710591122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20535,"speakerName":"Katarina","textMapHash":235073394,"text":"...I hope she doesn't think of me.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":710591118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1204014650,"text":"She's still alive, and she's doing great.","nextNodeIds":[710591119]},{"nodeId":710591104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":392513114,"text":"So we came over for a chat.","nextNodeIds":[710591105]}]},{"talkId":7105912,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":true,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7106001","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7226618","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7226618","1","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_NOT_RECEIVE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""]